# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AGORA website repository
#
# The repo root IS the Astro website, plus its small branding source and the
# web-optimized project images. The multi-gigabyte RAW asset archive is kept
# local only — several files exceed GitHub's 100 MB limit, and the web-ready
# derivatives are generated into src/content/projects/ by
# scripts/import_projects.py.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Raw asset archive (local working files, not for git)
/Projects/
/Background/
/Index images/

# Node / Astro build artifacts
node_modules/
dist/
.astro/
.output/
.vercel/
.netlify/

# Local scratch (backups, working PDFs, one-off scripts)
/tmp/

# Large binary formats (safety net if any land inside tracked folders)
*.psd
*.ai.bak

# Claude Code local (machine-specific) settings
.claude/settings.local.json

# Environment & secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Local cleanup / Python cache
/_to_delete/
__pycache__/
